{"title":"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> of points in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane is symmetric about the origin, both coordinate axes, and the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> is in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, what is the smallest number of points in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2cd6ba32fc5929b00180c94476da65f12f600a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 8\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/6/876b66789c31005ef23e41081d8f7c10137faaa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> is in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, then its reflection in the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/0/a40fee4603b4536f856dde720ee499468ace443f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/8790f46883a296366f038323844601dd2cde9ba6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, is also in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Now by reflecting these points in both coordinate axes, we quickly deduce that every point of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/23521f6eca785daff8420a51175e9b597c465c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\pm 2, \\pm 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87c6aac1c25085142987ed60f67a0a940c66b9af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\pm 3, \\pm 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> must be in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Moreover, by drawing out this set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points, we observe that it satisfies all of the required symmetry conditions, so no more points need to be added to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Accordingly, the smallest possible number of points in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is precisely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7321d4a0b2f2cbdac92d9fab2d4e4f6ca3316370.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A\">2003 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AM